{"id":113,"name":"chansey","speciesId":113,"dex":113,"form":"normal","generation":1,"types":["normal"],"stats":{"hp":250,"attack":5,"defense":5,"special-attack":35,"special-defense":105,"speed":50},"abilities":[{"name":"natural-cure","hidden":false},{"name":"serene-grace","hidden":false},{"name":"healer","hidden":true}],"height":11,"weight":346,"baseExp":395,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/113.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/113.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/113.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/113.ogg","genus":"Egg Pokémon","genusPt":"Pokémon de ovo","flavor":[{"version":"red","text":"A rare and elusive POKéMON that is said to bring happiness to those who manage to get it."},{"version":"yellow","text":"A gentle and kind­ hearted POKéMON that shares its nutritious eggs if it sees an injured POKéMON."},{"version":"gold","text":"It walks carefully to prevent its egg from breaking. However, it is extremely fast at running away."},{"version":"silver","text":"Few in number and difficult to cap­ ture, it is said to bring happiness to the trainer who catches it."},{"version":"crystal","text":"People try to catch it for its extremely nutritious eggs, but it rarely can be found."},{"version":"ruby","text":"CHANSEY lays nutritionally excellent eggs on an everyday basis. The eggs are so delicious, they are easily and eagerly devoured by even those people who have lost their appetite."},{"version":"emerald","text":"CHANSEY lay nutritionally excellent eggs every day. The eggs are so delicious, they are eagerly devoured by even those people who have lost their appetite."},{"version":"firered","text":"It lays several eggs a day. The eggs are apparently rich in nutrients and extremely delicious."},{"version":"leafgreen","text":"A rare and elusive POKéMON that is said to bring happiness to those who manage to catch one."},{"version":"diamond","text":"It is said to deliver happiness. Being compassionate, it shares its eggs with injured people."},{"version":"pearl","text":"It lays several eggs a day and won’t share them with those who have evil in their hearts."},{"version":"platinum","text":"A kindly Pokémon that lays highly nutritious eggs and shares them with injured Pokémon or people."},{"version":"soulsilver","text":"Being few in number and difficult to capture, it is said to bring happiness to the Trainer who catches it."},{"version":"omega-ruby","text":"Chansey lays nutritionally excellent eggs on an everyday basis. The eggs are so delicious, they are easily and eagerly devoured by even those people who have lost their appetite."},{"version":"sun","text":"The eggs laid by Chansey are rich in nutrients and a favorite food of many Pokémon."},{"version":"moon","text":"Not only are these Pokémon fast runners, they’re also few in number, so anyone who finds one must be lucky indeed."},{"version":"ultra-sun","text":"It seems that other Pokémon’s efforts to take its delicious, nutritious egg away from it caused Chansey to get faster at fleeing."},{"version":"ultra-moon","text":"Because the eggs on their bellies have been overharvested by people in the past, the Chansey population remains very small."},{"version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"A gentle and kindhearted Pokémon that shares its nutritious eggs if it sees an injured Pokémon."},{"version":"sword","text":"The egg Chansey carries is not only delicious but also packed with nutrition. It’s used as a high-class cooking ingredient."},{"version":"shield","text":"This species was once very slow. To protect their eggs from other creatures, these Pokémon became able to flee quickly."},{"version":"legends-arceus","text":"This purehearted Pokémon shares its eggs with the injured."}],"flavorPt":"Este Pokémon de coração puro comp